{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112345510506016768"]}, "author_id": "1147761326", "created_at": "2026-10-20T00:49:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112345520412999931"], "id": "2112345520412999931", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4764615733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112205825418904014", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@abasu4ever Allen park at 04am see the crowd https://t.co/Sc87MT1BZT", "url": "https://x.com/shaileshrtiwari/status/2112345520412999931"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112272706607415296", "3_2112272706552868864"]}, "author_id": "1055805061853573121", "created_at": "2026-10-19T20:00:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112272708859789319"], "id": "2112272708859789319", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Financial Literacy Educator Laura Marsh &amp; Downtown Fort Myers Customer Service Representative Erin Leatherwood recently visited Allen Park Elementary to teach kindergarteners through our Smart Cents Financial Literacy Education Program. https://t.co/KchPfTE0gj https://t.co/ISho2l4PyI", "url": "https://x.com/BankSanibel/status/2112272708859789319"}, {"author_id": "602691307", "created_at": "2026-10-19T19:12:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112260652622659886"], "id": "2112260652622659886", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Watched @BanglaRepublic  today night the Allen Park Durga Puja organised by \nBJP leader Sankudeb Ponda Ji.\n  Delighted to see AI based crowd management control machine a bit expensive technique.Perrhaps it is first seen in Durga Puja pandal in Kolkata and districts. It can", "url": "https://x.com/ProfSudhir/status/2112260652622659886"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112249016528539648"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112249040251637894"], "id": "2112249040251637894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2661, "like_count": 64, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112234079160795137"]}, "author_id": "633485882", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:56:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112241392076669075"], "id": "2112241392076669075", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 264, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Rajkummar Rao and producer Ankur Garg joined Sourav Ganguly for Mahashtami celebrations at the former cricketer\u2019s Kolkata home. They later visited some of the city\u2019s well-known Durga Puja pandals, including Maddox Square and Allen Park. Rajkummar will portray Ganguly in the https://t.co/B2Oh8Pev6E", "url": "https://x.com/News9Tweets/status/2112241392076669075"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112201864670584832"]}, "author_id": "19897138", "created_at": "2026-10-19T15:19:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112202039405285382"], "id": "2112202039405285382", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3305, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Sourav Ganguly hosted actor Rajkummar Rao and producer Ankur Garg at his Kolkata residence for Mahashtami celebrations. The trio visited iconic Durga Puja pandals, including Maddox Square and Allen Park, as part of a festive outing ahead of Dada: The Sourav Ganguly Story, https://t.co/khlJH7LXrt", "url": "https://x.com/IndiaToday/status/2112202039405285382"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097407140016128", "3_2112097407140057088", "3_2112097407182000128", "3_2112097407169437696"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097414836531229"], "id": "2112097414836531229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 NISHAAN makes headlines!\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition finds a place across the press. Grateful to the journalists sharing our story of faith, art and heritage. \ud83d\ude4f\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark https://t.co/R3X70tWnZs", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097414836531229"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097205490528256", "3_2112097205490495488", "3_2112097205448495104", "3_2112097205448499200"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097213392580776"], "id": "2112097213392580776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 A mark of faith. A story making headlines.\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition and \u201cNISHAAN \u2014 The Mark\u201d finds a place across the press. \ud83d\ude4f\u2728\n\nThank you to the publications\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja20d https://t.co/bzz28fW05M", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097213392580776"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111887009405075456", "3_2111887024684933120", "3_2111887044637270016", "3_2111887070134505472"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:28:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111887088958513154"], "id": "2111887088958513154", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 620, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#88 Visited Ekdalia. Beautiful pandal and pratima as always. Look at the posture of pratima. That is what sets it apart from the rest. Face, eyes aren't the only things. Look at how mother and rest are sitting. Absolutely stunning. Greatest of South Kolkata for a reason. https://t.co/cfJE7N9sHP", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111887088958513154"}, {"author_id": "2609353712", "created_at": "2026-10-18T17:22:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111870491292324273"], "id": "2111870491292324273", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1023150691030728704", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111865784096174157", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@an1sh123 Gotokaler drissho.\n\nBhir valoi chilo. Shoru rasta bole dhukte ektu oshubidha hoyechilo, ar khub e baaje crowd management chilo. But ha harmless. \n\nAr ekta advice, agge Sikdar Bagan dekha ta bekar, onekta ghurte hobe. Agge Nabin Pally dekhar por Sikdar Bagan e dhuko.", "url": "https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2111870491292324273"}, {"author_id": "1393899939189698564", "created_at": "2026-10-18T16:29:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111857217792360796"], "id": "2111857217792360796", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 689, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Guys, how is the crowd in Allen Park at around 6 PM?\n\nHow's the line n crowd management, how safe and professional it is, how are the exit points?\n\nPls guide", "url": "https://x.com/ThaneOfTracks/status/2111857217792360796"}, {"author_id": "1304835685610737665", "created_at": "2026-10-18T14:56:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111833790557605926"], "id": "2111833790557605926", "in_reply_to_user_id": "174285951", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 449, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111825968365273478", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mayukhrghosh People love pujo crowd?? Seriously?? I want to know who those people are!!\n2019 was when I went pandal hopping in Kolkata on Shoptomi. I swore not to do that ever again! Escaped a stampede like situation in ekdalia! Joto rajjer chapri, Bihari crowd rastay!", "url": "https://x.com/Tinniz1/status/2111833790557605926"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111792371742732289"]}, "author_id": "129775369", "created_at": "2026-10-18T12:12:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111792440822902825"], "id": "2111792440822902825", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This is being circulated. I visited Allen Park about 45 mins back, it's open.\n\n@SuvenduWB\n@KolkataPolice \n@shankudebbjp \n@SamikBJP https://t.co/gU5uYPP5pa", "url": "https://x.com/prabirkrsarkar/status/2111792440822902825"}, {"author_id": "1674681718895411201", "created_at": "2026-10-18T06:32:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111707069191729395"], "id": "2111707069191729395", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3236685834", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 85, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111671635707314677", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@goonereol I haven\u2019t been there in recent times but I was turned away from Kashi Bose lane the year before on tritiya. Majority pandals have always opened from choturthi panchami only. Last year on choturthi there was still work going on in sikdar Bagan and nabinpally didn\u2019t allow us in.", "url": "https://x.com/reindeerdodo89/status/2111707069191729395"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111679989943087104", "3_2111680000927956992"]}, "author_id": "420943020", "created_at": "2026-10-18T04:45:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111680018418147478"], "id": "2111680018418147478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 195, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Major Durga Puja Pandals have been temporarily closed for Public Entry till the Crowd Management and Security Assessment in On after the Chorebagan Stampede Incident that took place last night due to continuos rain and excessive volatile crowd.\n\n\ud83d\uded1 Tala Pratoy\n\ud83d\uded1 Chetla Agrani https://t.co/kIAWePUkrZ", "url": "https://x.com/kumar3798/status/2111680018418147478"}, {"author_id": "82332227", "created_at": "2026-10-18T03:10:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111656025082433895"], "id": "2111656025082433895", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1366828212307644417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 156, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111549790542790806", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@TheJulyBird The last thing I\u2019ll ever do in my life is defend the BJP. But over the last two or three years, I\u2019ve increasingly noticed the dehatification of the Puja crowd. I\u2019ve been a pandal hopper since 2009\u201310. This year, the IT cell picked a few pujas to flex their crowd numbers. Last", "url": "https://x.com/yansan/status/2111656025082433895"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111603436894744576"]}, "author_id": "3007649773", "created_at": "2026-10-17T23:41:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111603526082396576"], "id": "2111603526082396576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 4819, "like_count": 82, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 13}, "text": "Its 5 am morning and this is park street area \u2026. People are still out for pandel hopping \ud83e\udef0\ud83c\udffc\u2764\ufe0f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffc Allen Park management has cautiously managed the crowd \ud83e\udd1f\ud83c\udffc https://t.co/ezdzzKT1cO", "url": "https://x.com/biharigurl/status/2111603526082396576"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111560942781906944", "3_2111560942828040193", "3_2111560942777716736", "3_2111560942781931520"]}, "author_id": "1523593545021411328", "created_at": "2026-10-17T20:52:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111560972871856630"], "id": "2111560972871856630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Safety disaster at Ganendra Mitra Lane (700004)! Couldn\u2019t even walk to my own doorstep today. Crowd feels like a mob due to illegal stalls &amp; pathetic management by Nabin Pally, Sikdar Bagan, Nalin Sarkar St &amp; North Tridhara.\n\nPlease help @KolkataPolice @paulagnimitra1 @SuvenduWB https://t.co/DAYZgEbo6J", "url": "https://x.com/ubot_777/status/2111560972871856630"}, {"author_id": "2937987107", "created_at": "2026-10-17T18:11:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111520485871903198"], "id": "2111520485871903198", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1423538697736056835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 551, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111518675769659877", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@TrikaTriggered Kolkatar bengali konodin e ei crowd create kora ta pochondo korto na. \nChotobelai mon e ache ekdaliar update dito anandabazar je 10k, 15k 9 ta ba 10tar shomoy lok hoyeche. Sei dori diye atke lok korto. Plus tar sthe ghupchi rastai babubagan.", "url": "https://x.com/darkbhobisyot/status/2111520485871903198"}, {"author_id": "803197771389861888", "created_at": "2026-10-17T18:05:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111518921622999095"], "id": "2111518921622999095", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4719, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "I\u2019m a big-time pandal hopper. Durga Puja evenings are something I look forward to every year. \u2764\ufe0f\n\nToday, I got ready and stepped out to visit Ahiritola, Kumartuli, Chorbagan, Chaltabagan and other nearby pandals.\n\nAfter visiting just two pujas, it started raining. I took a cab", "url": "https://x.com/financialsarthi/status/2111518921622999095"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-17T17:36:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111511570547146781"], "id": "2111511570547146781", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1685563270986637313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111511325029597592", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@safikali_01 @surajitdasgupta Allen Park, Park Street ke Durga Puja pandal ke gate pe Ardhan\u0101r\u012bshwara (Shiva-Parvati) ka bada illuminated structure hai light projection show ke saath. Pehli baar wahan puja ho rahi hai, theme Tandav hai. Crowd photos le raha hai, andar Maa Durga ka idol. Koi incident nahi, bas", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2111511570547146781"}, {"author_id": "1170441364468830211", "created_at": "2026-10-17T16:42:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111497482039406848", "2111498040070561994", "2111501783784947797"], "id": "2111498040070561994", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "17 lives lost , still counting and  several injured in a stampede at a Durga Puja pandal  at CHALTABAGAN SARBOJANIN DURGA PUJA in Kolkata. A horrifying testament to the government\u2019s abject failure in crowd management, public safety and administrative accountability.\n\nNever in", "url": "https://x.com/Anika_Breaths/status/2111498040070561994"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111449275335139328"]}, "author_id": "141584822", "created_at": "2026-10-17T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111449653782925485"], "id": "2111449653782925485", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1107, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kolkata, West Bengal: Large numbers of devotees visited Durga Puja pandals across Kolkata on Saptami to offer prayers to Goddess Durga. At Ekdalia Evergreen, the pandal was designed in the style of Gujarat\u2019s iconic Somnath Temple, featuring depictions of Lord Shiva in different https://t.co/5ZwGBcm2lm", "url": "https://x.com/ians_india/status/2111449653782925485"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111348739982163968", "3_2111348756201533440", "3_2111348770889965568"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-17T06:49:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111348784970231892"], "id": "2111348784970231892", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 256, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#69 Visited Kalighat Sanghasree. One of the most prestigious and heritage pujos of South Kolkata. They pioneered and popularized \"scenary pujo\" back in 90s/00s. The pandal and pratima is beautiful. Highly recommend visiting. https://t.co/oa9tcs4zQR", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111348784970231892"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111342216124006400", "3_2111342229038215168", "3_2111342241998622720", "3_2111342255575613440"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-17T06:23:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111342265117626541"], "id": "2111342265117626541", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 544, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#66 Visited Kalighat Milan Sangha lmao.